    "updated_at": "2022-07-28T20:59:15Z",
    "body": "This is very interesting behavior and I wonder if it is caused by memory pressure due to the allocation of ArrayBuffers for the received data. Can you provide example code which demonstrates this issue with a common microcontroller like an Arduino?",
